<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="692560"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="906371263"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="親愛なる世界へ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Ceui &amp; AUGUST"/><amll:meta key="album" value="穢翼のユースティア (ORIGINAL SOUND TRACK)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:17.452"><div begin="00:27.157" end="05:17.452"><p begin="00:27.157" end="00:37.479" itunes:key="L1">Silent night 降り続ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寂静的夜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Silent night</span></p><p begin="00:37.480" end="00:48.040" itunes:key="L2">悲しみ ふりはらい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悲伤不断降落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kana xi mi fu li ha la i</span></p><p begin="00:48.041" end="00:58.646" itunes:key="L3">どんな言葉でなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟要说些什么</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na koto ba de na la</span></p><p begin="00:58.647" end="01:08.104" itunes:key="L4">寄り添えるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">才能让你我更加靠近</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo li so e lu no</span></p><p begin="01:08.105" end="01:14.690" itunes:key="L5">暁（あかつき）に 流れ落ちる星<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拂晓时分滑落的星星</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">akacuki ni naga re o qi lu hoxi</span></p><p begin="01:14.691" end="01:20.045" itunes:key="L6">世界が目覚める<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让世界渐渐苏醒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se kai ga me za me lu</span></p><p begin="01:20.046" end="01:55.354" itunes:key="L7">あなたが歩む大地に 祈りを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为你即将踏上的大地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ga ayu mu dai qi ni</span></p><p begin="01:55.355" end="02:05.333" itunes:key="L8">Silent heart 触れられない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">静默的心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Silent heart</span></p><p begin="02:05.334" end="02:15.690" itunes:key="L9">愛を嘆かないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请不要为爱叹息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ai wo nage ka na i de</span></p><p begin="02:15.691" end="02:26.715" itunes:key="L10">願い 託す光<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寄托心愿的光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">nega i taku su hikali</span></p><p begin="02:26.716" end="02:35.928" itunes:key="L11">星座になる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">化成了星座</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sei za ni na lu</span></p><p begin="02:35.929" end="02:42.613" itunes:key="L12">暁（あかつき）に 染まる空の果て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在被拂晓染色的天空尽头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">akacuki ni so ma lu sola no ha te</span></p><p begin="02:42.614" end="02:48.103" itunes:key="L13">私を感じて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我感受到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wataxi wo kan ji te</span></p><p begin="02:48.104" end="02:59.197" itunes:key="L14">あなたと同じ景色を 見ている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正和你一起注视着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta to ona ji ke xiki wo</span></p><p begin="02:59.198" end="03:34.133" itunes:key="L15">はじまりの 白い夜明けを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">初始的</span></p><p begin="03:34.134" end="03:38.898" itunes:key="L16">あなたと出会った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想与你邂逅在这</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta to de a ta</span></p><p begin="03:38.899" end="03:44.254" itunes:key="L17">愛（いと）し 世界で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ito xi se kai de</span></p><p begin="03:44.255" end="03:55.967" itunes:key="L18">信じる強さ 知った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是你教会我那信任的坚强</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">xin ji lu cuyo sa xi ta</span></p><p begin="03:55.968" end="04:00.991" itunes:key="L19">”I stay with your heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我与你的心相依相偎</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I stay with your heart</span></p><p begin="04:00.992" end="04:03.079" itunes:key="L20">So sweet<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此亲昵甜蜜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">So sweet tight dreaming in your heart</span></p><p begin="04:03.080" end="04:11.441" itunes:key="L21">Tight dreaming in your heart</p><p begin="04:11.442" end="04:15.625" itunes:key="L22">Hey yey hah…”<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿嘿 哈哈哈啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hey yey hah</span></p><p begin="04:15.626" end="04:21.372" itunes:key="L23">暁（あかつき）に 流れ落ちる星<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拂晓时分滑落的星星</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">akacuki ni naga re o qi lu hoxi</span></p><p begin="04:21.373" end="04:26.862" itunes:key="L24">世界が目覚める<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让世界渐渐苏醒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se kai ga me za me lu</span></p><p begin="04:26.863" end="05:17.452" itunes:key="L25">あなたが歩む大地に 祈りを 捧げ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为你即将踏上的大地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ga ayu mu dai qi ni</span></p></div></body></tt>